    "description": "In a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, if you are not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>, you can take a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> in addition to the one other Action normally allowed. If you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>, you can take a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>.<br><br><i>Normal:</i> In a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, if you are not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>, you can take a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>. If you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>, you can take no <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>.",
